OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLargely dry during daytime with
OL,6,Fsome good sunny spells, especially in
OL,7,Fthe morning. More in the way of cloud
OL,8,Fthrough the afternoon and becoming
OL,9,Frather breezy.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMainly dry at first. Turning
OL,12,Fcloudy through the evening with a few
OL,13,Fshowery outbreaks of rain spreading
OL,14,Fnortheast through the night. Rather
OL,15,Fwindy around coasts.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FCloudy and windy with patchy
OL,18,Frain, becoming heavy for a time during
OL,19,Fthe day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
